  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T14:08:12.684475Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T14:11:35.010415Z",
  "totalBlocks": 50,
  "translatedBlocks": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7136a4166ec637c2",
      "translationZh": "我一直在尝试让 DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp 在配备 2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 的机器上通过 SGLang 正常运行，想着把结果发在这里，供其他也在 SM120 硬件上折腾这个模型的人参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0df46ae3e246a308",
      "translationZh": "最终配置现在已经成功支持文本、视觉，以及一个包含 269,320 个 token 的真实提示词。实现这一目标的过程中，暴露出了三个互不相关的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0cd8c9e1a98afa85",
      "translationZh": "1. SM120 sparse-MLA 视觉预填充崩溃",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7969968f5c9e88f",
      "translationZh": "基础视觉测试可以正常运行，但一张尺寸更大的真实图像总会导致调度器崩溃，报错如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1afd78db28b032e2",
      "translationZh": "追踪后发现，DSV4 的图像跨度可见性逻辑导致主 SWA 缓存宽度在逻辑上达到 topk=448。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f576381be001ac1",
      "translationZh": "现有的 SM120 包装层对不受支持的宽度采用了类似解码阶段的处理方式，进行填充：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f02a7a39e2ec4894",
      "translationZh": "但 FlashInfer 0.6.18 对 DSV4 双缓存预填充的支持范围，远小于其对解码／单缓存的支持范围。具体来说，原生双缓存路径要求主缓存为 topk=128；将 448→512 进行填充，并不能让完整形状得到支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c30c21b05e23c69e",
      "translationZh": "修复方法是在填充／分派之前，增加完整的预填充能力检查。不受支持的双缓存预填充形状会回退到 SGLang 现有的 Triton sparse-MLA 实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02405605fe6b4244",
      "translationZh": "该回退方案已经能够处理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "496ed1bb79e30f47",
      "translationZh": "并使用 LSE 合并主缓存 + 额外缓存的结果，因此我们不必舍弃任何 DSV4 混合/SWA 语义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9620120678bc585",
      "translationZh": "打上补丁后，之前导致崩溃的同一个请求现在会输出以下日志：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a54d23e64824943",
      "translationZh": "并返回正确的 Vision 结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c9c7511d91abd10",
      "translationZh": "重复发送图像请求也成功了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "707aaa724fd648dc",
      "translationZh": "2. 约 269k 的上下文导致索引器 CUDA OOM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e39bb0434915d59",
      "translationZh": "接着，我尝试了一个包含 269,320 个 token 的纯文本请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13a3da6a4d285204",
      "translationZh": "模型在预填充期间崩溃了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9df15de557de123",
      "translationZh": "回溯信息指向这里：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "033a11900e9f6d53",
      "translationZh": "DSV4 c4 索引器内部。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fe5d568bf0c0a07",
      "translationZh": "因此，尽管 KV/缓存池能够容纳，索引器仍会创建一个临时的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b66430fa57cbfe82",
      "translationZh": "logits 张量，其大小会随上下文增长，而且 mem_fraction_static 未将其计入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03419243b944815e",
      "translationZh": "这对应于 SGLang 上游正在处理的同类问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91c3df884e4eae0c",
      "translationZh": "我移植了按行切片的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f4e901f33a75492",
      "translationZh": "使用当前空闲 GPU 内存的一部分为临时 logits 预留预算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2534bdb33a5b77c4",
      "translationZh": "将查询行拆分成多个块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2c3e4fd8b4fe167",
      "translationZh": "按块计算 logits + top-k",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ba185da651a676a",
      "translationZh": "处理下一个切片之前，丢弃当前 logits 切片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8909242ca1e0cd2b",
      "translationZh": "保留完整的 c4 宽度，因此实际索引器结果不变",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c483fc0ad04e5f3",
      "translationZh": "对于此前失败的工作负载，在观测到的可用内存条件下，瞬时内存占用被限制在每个 GPU 约 0.3 GiB，而不再可能需要约 2 GiB 来存放完整的 logits 缓冲区。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c68a9f9a11438ce5",
      "translationZh": "重新测试了同一个请求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "399f1d36f3d4e17c",
      "translationZh": "因此，这套配置现在确实经过了约 269k 长度提示词的实际测试，而不只是配置了 --context-length 278528。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6392c23ad70ce2d9",
      "translationZh": "3. 视觉预览功能破坏了多轮工具调用历史",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c634354cbb2150ba",
      "translationZh": "这个问题尤其奇怪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7baa7b5918d83e2a",
      "translationZh": "将 Vision 模型用作编程/智能体模型时，它起初能正确调用工具，随后开始生成如下形式的调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c70f72b78a0cbc4",
      "translationZh": "而实际的工具 schema 只是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c74744014757dec",
      "translationZh": "在出现验证错误后，情况可能会逐步恶化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00961e97e541b40d",
      "translationZh": "一个有用的实验是，将同一份对话历史切换到我之前已确认正常的旧版非 Vision DSV4 SGLang 镜像上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e3e1f93dfcf5306",
      "translationZh": "于是，我对工具调用历史的编码路径进行了差异比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58feda5c1f8d755a",
      "translationZh": "最终发现，这个 bug 出在 Vision 预览版的 encoding_dsv4.py 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "561ace258bc7328e",
      "translationZh": "SGLang 会对 OpenAI 进行规范化处理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b460955a0c3a794c",
      "translationZh": "然后才进行 DSV4 历史编码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e24802022c3c82ab",
      "translationZh": "但这个版本的 encode_arguments_to_dsml() 实际上做的是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb7882f35c78f26e",
      "translationZh": "对已经规范化的 dict 调用 json.loads() 会抛出异常，因此回退逻辑会直接将它包装起来：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8d3229d0131e6f7",
      "translationZh": "随后，模型会在自己的历史记录中看到这样的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e0fcb766d4cc03d",
      "translationZh": "所以，模型并不是凭空幻觉出了这个包装结构——是服务器通过模型的对话历史，教给了它错误的模式结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c57be935c557755e",
      "translationZh": "CPU 往返测试现在与我已知正常的非 Vision SGLang 技术栈完全一致，包括多轮对话和包含错误历史的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b511370d0b68b91",
      "translationZh": "最终的本地镜像现在能通过以下测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e191575ef0b1020",
      "translationZh": "我最终采用的服务配置大致如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a505173882abe1c8",
      "translationZh": "有一点需要提醒：我刻意将 DSPARK 块大小设为 4，尽管检查点标示的是 5。当前技术栈在深度为 5 时存在 SM120 正确性问题，因此我不会通过将它改为 5 来“修复”那条警告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0993c9099789d7a9",
      "translationZh": "我将每项改动都单独封装为一个小型衍生镜像，而不是把 SGLang/FlashInfer 中随意挑选的组件一起升级。最终的镜像基本上是这样的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84ff1dd54b6fe9f7",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/shrug_hellifino 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "prefill",
      "briefZh": "预填充",
      "explanationZh": "模型处理输入提示词并建立注意力缓存的阶段，与逐步生成输出的解码阶段相区别。"
    },
    {
      "term": "scheduler",
      "briefZh": "调度器",
      "explanationZh": "负责安排推理任务执行的组件，文中它在处理较大的真实图像时崩溃。"
    },
    {
      "term": "decode",
      "briefZh": "解码",
